      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ana axaás, i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Heewí, dasuuko tsár taa laqwaál nee aayór wák i deer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár inooín tawa dasuú /amaatliite tawa yaamaá Misrír hooti, inooín tana fquús, asma tana ya/án iseemaaín kiwa kwatmiiti nee daaqaay, nee kiwa harneeti inooín niri sli'imuuse tleehhitiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dasír ur ka bay Ohola, nee ar niina ka bay Oholiba. Naagáy sleémeero nay kwe'eé' tleehhitiyé', na/iieé' awa daaqaay nee awa dasuuwo ngiri laqwaaliyé'. Ohola a gixsár Samaria nee Oholiba a gixár Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala tam Oholiba a harer'eene, inós ina kumít fuqto, nee sla'aaruuseerós tidár yaamá Ashuru gana ilatleerús. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sla'aaruuseerós tí a slaqwaruusér tlabaá sirbo/ ngaa dahas, nee a waawitá nee geeraharuusér slaqwara. Inooín sleémeero a masoombár hhohho' nee a múk farsuú xuú' i tsa/amtooro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohola tsaatu'uuma gana tléhh nee waawituú Ashuru sleémeero, inós tiri meetagás ar munguaá slaqsi'iidá' sleémeero awa umuú hhawaatuú aa slai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós ina kumít tsaatu'uuma tlehhtuuwo, tidá' aa iimu/uún iimír qoomár iwa baraá yaamaá Misri, qoomaadá' tawa dasír /amaatliito'o, nee hhawaate nina alqaatiyé', slaqooín ngiri tsaeemisiyé' dirós wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe aníng inós ngiri haniís dabaá sla'aaruuseerós tidár Ashuru, tidá' inós aa ló'wa slá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí inós gana tlaba' duúx, gari /aankweetsií geexáy. Na/iiwós kina ohín, nee inósár kilá' kari gaás ar paánga. Sakwasleemár aa sleér tari intsaahhasa dír /ameenár hatlae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Hho'oorós Oholiba adoorí gana aán, ala inós ina ak harwaaráhh tlehhma'aá fuqto, tlehhmi'iiwós ki ak tlakw ta awa hho'oorós Oholaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós múk Ashuru guna ló'wa ilatleerús nee ga/awuuseero, nee geeraharuusér slaqwara, nee slaqwaruuseedá' tlabaá slaqwara gaa dahas, nee slaqwaruusér faras i tsa/amtooro gu ló'wa xuu', inooín sleémeero a masoombár hhohho'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana tsaáhh adór inós tira ló'wa meetagás. Ala looeemaawo inooín tsaraawo ta alqón.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala Oholiba fuqtós gana ló'wa tlahhás, sleeme kari sla'atís nee slaqsa'aá múk Kaldayo, kudá' taa gooín baraá koo/írí alé, kari qaalín ar kal'aá da/aten, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i him'ér koná' afetleero, nee gawaá sager'ine i warqamaá urén koná'. Sleémeero a slaqmís nee waawitá, slaqsa'aá múk Babuloni, yaamuloouusér yaamaá Kaldayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós slaqsi'iikaá mukwí ngiwa aán, hheehha gari gás, gura' gari óh, ya/abuuse gari ya/áp ay yaamaá Kaldayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy, múk Babuloni iri amoorósií qatuú áy. Ngiri slasla/aresiyé' ar ilatleerir'ín tidá'. Qoomár ngiwa hhe'eesiyé' slasla/areesaro, inós iri amoosií tleér as tiwa aahhiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós iwa kumít fuqto nee /aankwetsuuwós laqaqaango, aníng ana máw adoodár kilá' aáng hho'oorós ngira máw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe ina ak búhh fuqto adoodár kilá' tawa /amaatliito'o ira fuqús baraá yaamaá Misrír wa alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós hhawaataá aa ló'wa slá' a kudá' hheehhar'in adór taqár daqwaaye, nee kudaá /uuruuín oo xwayla oo adór kuquú farsuú yaqaambe.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
